<p><strong>SCP-4152: BASEMENT LOVE, Acrylic on canvas</strong><br />
<strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/devonmartin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1985558); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1985558&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607626315" alt="devonmartin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1985558)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/devonmartin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1985558); return false;">devonmartin</a></span></p>
<div style="text-align: center;">
<h6 id="toc0"><span>If you like this, check out some of my other articles:</span></h6>
<div class="list-pages-box">    

